@nsobid-0EFFE4AF1DEC3A7966B934D4A7C3D2BF566A9C62

# Paper Mario: The Thousand-Year Door 1.0.1 - Text Always Skippable

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// Lets every message be fast-forwarded, including ones not seen before.
//
// When a message opens, the message window marks it skippable only if
// sub_710029A848 finds the message's hashed id in the list of messages
// already shown. The check now always succeeds.

@enabled
0029A848 200080D2   // MOV X0, #1 = already shown (was SUB SP, SP, #0x60)
0029A84C C0035FD6   // RET (was STP X29, X30, [SP, #0x30])
@stop

// Original cheat by NatalieWhatever. Ported to pchtxt and verified against
// 1.0.1.
//
// https://github.com/RAMDRAGONS/switch-patches
